@startuml

title SerialToAnalog App - Static View

package "SerialToAnalog App" {
    [Routine Handler] as routineHandler
    note right of routineHandler
        RID 0x0100: ADC trigger + read result
    end note
    [Channel Manager] as channelMgr
    [Sampling Controller] as samplingCtrl
}

[ADC Driver] as adcDriver
[Config Service] as configService

routineHandler --> channelMgr : Route by channel
channelMgr --> adcDriver : ADC operations
samplingCtrl --> adcDriver : Start/stop conversion

note right of channelMgr
    Config loaded from Config Service at init.
    No runtime config saving here.
end note

@enduml